Additional convention for renewal of the armistice, dated at Trier,
                            December 13, 1918 (Treaties, Conventions,
                                etc., 1910–23, iii, 3315; Der Waffenstillstand, i, 130);

Financial protocol, dated at Trier, December 13, 1918 (Treaties, Conventions, etc., 1910–23, iii, 3322; Der
